## 4. Execution & TCS Digital Interview Strategy

| Step | Terminal Command / Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **1. Install Packages** | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |
| **2. Start FastAPI Backend** | `uvicorn backend:app --reload` (Verify endpoints at `http://127.0.0`) |
| **3. Start Streamlit UI** | `streamlit run frontend.py` (Opens dashboard at `http://localhost:8501`) |

### Interview Talking Point — Why Two Databases & No JWT?
> "I designed this project to demonstrate decoupled full-stack architecture: Streamlit handles presentation, FastAPI enforces strict Pydantic validation at the API boundary, MySQL ensures ACID-compliant storage for core transactional records, and SQLite offloads lightweight local logging/FAQ reads to reduce database bottlenecks. For a production rollout, adding OAuth2/JWT middleware in FastAPI is the immediate next step."
